cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Jadart: a decompiler for Flutter/Dart AOT snapshots"
message: "If you use this software or its findings in academic work, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: ir0nbyte
repository-code: "https://github.com/IR0NBYTE/Jadart"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-06"
abstract: >-
  Jadart recovers the class tree, method bodies as pseudo-Dart, the string pool,
  embedded const data and virtual-call names from a stripped Flutter AOT snapshot
  (libapp.so or an iOS App binary). It parses the Dart AOT clustered snapshot format
  directly, keyed on the snapshot version hash, and refuses to parse a release whose
  grammar is not registered rather than producing a plausible but fictional object graph.
keywords:
  - flutter
  - dart
  - reverse-engineering
  - decompiler
  - mobile-security
  - aot
license: MIT
